{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20301","headline":"乌夜啼引 · 张籍","name":"乌夜啼引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦乌啼哑哑，夜啼长安吏人家。\n吏人得罪囚在狱，倾家卖产将自赎。\n少妇起听夜啼乌，知是官家有赦书。\n下牀心喜不重寐，未明上堂贺舅姑。\n少妇语啼乌，汝啼慎勿虚。\n借汝庭树作高巢，年年不令伤尔雏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}